 "summary": "The vanishing of H\u00b9(X, \ud835\udcaa_E) for large E, the surjectivity of the Mittag-Leffler map, the general \u010cech-cohomology multiplication map and the existence of a nonconstant meromorphic function are not in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the closest existing item, divisorCechCohomologyIsoOfPrincipalDivisorEq, covers only the case where the divisor is exactly D - E. The proofs reuse the divisorSheafMeromorphicMul laws, the h\u00b9 monotonicity and surjectivity lemmas, range_mittagLefflerConnecting, exists_toMeromorphic_notMem_range_algebraMap and Mathlib's eigenvalue and finrank lemmas.",
